where the second last equality follows from the definition of $m_{1,\alpha}^\circ$ in \eqref{mu1ltip1liersss} and \eqref{def_of23sm}, and the last equality follows from evenness of $m_{1,\alpha}$ and exchange $n_1$ and $n_2$ in the summation.
